<title>SWITZERLAND: ALPINE SKIING-TRAINING TIMES FROM MEN'S DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-TRAINING TIMES FROM MEN'S DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>WENGEN, Switzerland 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top training times</p>
<p>on Wednesday for a men's Alpine skiing World Cup downhill</p>
<p>scheduled on Saturday:</p>
<p>1.Werner Franz (Austria) two minutes 25.09 seconds</p>
<p>2. Atle Skaardal (Norway) 2:26.47</p>
<p>3. Patrick Ortlieb (Austria) 2:26.61</p>
<p>4. Fritz Strobl (Austria) 2:26.88</p>
<p>5. Peter Runggaldier (Italy) 2:26.96</p>
<p>6. Bruno Kernen (Switzerland) 2:27.01</p>
<p>7. Franco Cavegn (Switzerland) 2:27.37</p>
<p>8. Pietro Vitalini (Italy) 2:27.59</p>
<p>9. Luc Alphand (France) 2:27.62</p>
<p>10. Hannes Trinkl (Austria) 2:27.72</p>
